---
import Button from '../components/Button.astro';
import CtaBand from '../components/CtaBand.astro';
import { site, withBase } from '../data/site';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Thai Biazzini | NARA Studio"
  description="Thai Biazzini built NARA Studio from six years inside agency, campaign, content and purpose-led marketing work. Start with the people already closest to the business."
  path="/about"
>
  <main id="main">
    <header class="page-hero">
      <div class="shell about-grid">
        <figure class="portrait-frame">
          <img
            class="portrait"
            src={withBase('/images/nara-portrait.jpg')}
            width="960"
            height="1200"
            alt="Black and white portrait of Thai Biazzini, founder of NARA Studio, wearing a tailored suit."
          />
        </figure>
        <div class="stack">
          <span class="eyebrow">About Thai</span>
          <h1>Built inside the work, not outside it.</h1>
          <p class="lede muted">
            Thai Biazzini has spent six years across agency, account growth, brand strategy, content, campaigns and purpose-led marketing.
          </p>
          <p>
            Across real estate, hospitality, personal brands and social-impact work, the pattern stayed the same: the strongest results appeared when the right story reached people who already had a reason to care.
          </p>
          <p>NARA Studio was built around that lesson.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="shell split">
        <div class="kicker">
          <span class="eyebrow">Point of view</span>
          <h2>Personal brand is not a vanity layer added after the sales system.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="stack">
          <p>
            For founder-led businesses, it is the trust layer that helps the market understand the offer, believe the proof and feel comfortable starting a conversation.
          </p>
          <p>The work should still be measured commercially.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section section-alt">
      <div class="shell split">
        <div class="kicker">
          <span class="eyebrow">What Thai brings</span>
          <h2>Strategy, activation and proof in one system.</h2>
        </div>
        <ul class="list">
          <li>brand and campaign direction;</li>
          <li>direct audience activation;</li>
          <li>founder interviewing and story extraction;</li>
          <li>proof-led content systems;</li>
          <li>cross-channel execution; and</li>
          <li>English, Portuguese and Spanish communication.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="shell split">
        <div class="kicker">
          <span class="eyebrow">How NARA works</span>
          <h2>The founder stays in the commercial conversation.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="stack">
          <p>
            Thai owns strategy, voice, creative direction and the quality of the market interaction. Ben supports offer architecture, systems, CRM and commercial measurement where required.
          </p>
          <p class="muted">The client brings the expertise, proof, relationships and sales conversations.</p>
          <div class="actions">
            <Button href="/apply" event="primary_cta_click" meta="about">{site.primaryCta}</Button>
            <Button href="/apply" variant="secondary" event="secondary_cta_click" meta="about-primary">Work With Thai</Button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <CtaBand
      title="If your work is stronger than your current market presence, start with the people already closest to it."
    />
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
